{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-liberty-house","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"liberty-house","about":"Strategically located in the Dubai International Financial Centre (DIFC), Liberty House Dubai is a mixed-use building featuring 42 stories with eight floors dedicated to commercial spaces. The stories above the office floors are used for residential purposes in the building. You can find excellent units for sale and rent in the L-shaped tower. Handed over in 2009 by ETA Star property developers, the Liberty House DIFC address features studio, 1, and 2-bedroom apartments and duplexes.When it comes to Liberty House parking, every Liberty House DIFC office and apartment has been allocated a designated parking lot. The basement levels and six floors above ground are all dedicated to parking in the Liberty House building. Also, the topmost floor has a leisure deck and a sitting area. It is a pet-friendly tower with a spacious play area for kids, swimming pools, and a well-equipped gym.","price":1290000,"title":"Liberty House","bitrix":{"id":329,"pf_id":"are.2.2685","source":null,"project_id":"Liberty House","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Liberty House DIFC","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"ETA Star Property","project_location":"DIFC"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/liberty_feat_75eab0a17b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/liberty_feat_75eab0a17b.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.21282585,"lng":55.2776348485216},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/liberty_8_91c24ce2fc.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/liberty_8_91c24ce2fc.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/liberty_1_765d5ba6d1.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/liberty_1_765d5ba6d1.webp